"Sizes"},"668":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-12","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#submenu","content":"Submenu"},"669":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-13","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"670":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-14","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"671":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-15","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#props","content":"Props"},"672":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-16","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#menu","content":"Menu"},"673":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-17","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#menutrigger","content":"MenuTrigger"},"674":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-18","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#menugroup","content":"MenuGroup"},"675":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-19","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#menuitem","content":"MenuItem"},"676":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-20","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#submenutrigger","content":"SubmenuTrigger"},"677":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-21","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu","content":"An accessible dropdown menu built on React Aria. It supports grouping with optional\ntitles, multi-select checkbox items, leading icons, submenus, and two sizes. It\nreuses Antares' `Popover` for the overlay and `Checkbox` indicator for selection."},"678":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-22","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"Grouping with an optional title via `MenuGroup`, plus `MenuSeparator` dividers"},"679":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-23","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"Multi-select groups: set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` on a `MenuGroup` to render\nits items as checkboxes, while other groups stay plain action items"},"680":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-24","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"Optional leading `icon` per item; links (`href`) and disabled items"},"681":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-25","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"Submenus via `SubmenuTrigger`"},"682":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-26","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"Two sizes (`sm`, `md`); set `size` explicitly on each submenu `Menu`"},"683":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-27","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"Usable anchored to a trigger or standalone (e.g. inside a bottom-sheet `Drawer`)"},"684":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-28","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#default","content":"A trigger with plain action items."},"685":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-29","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#controlled","content":"`MenuTrigger` exposes its open state via `isOpen`/`onOpenChange`,\nwhich can be used to drive the rotation of a chevron icon."},"686":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-30","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#bottom-sheet","content":"On small screens a menu often reads better as a bottom sheet than an anchored\npopover. Since `Menu` works standalone, drop it into a bottom `Drawer`."},"687":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-31","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#groups","content":"Labeled groups separated by dividers, a multi-select checkbox group mixed with\nplain action groups, leading icons, a disabled item, and a link."},"688":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-32","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#multiple-selection","content":"A `MenuGroup` with `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` renders its items as checkboxes.\nDrive the checked items with `selectedKeys` + `onSelectionChange` or\nseed them uncontrolled with `defaultSelectedKeys`. Keys correspond to each\n`MenuItem`'s `id`."},"689":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-33","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#rich-content-from-an-item","content":"A `Menu` is a collection, so it only renders `MenuItem`, `MenuGroup`,\n`MenuSeparator`, and `SubmenuTrigger` children. Rich content inside a `Menu`\nor submenu is not supported. To show a `Calendar`, let the item close the\nmenu from `onAction` and open a separate `Popover` anchored to the trigger\nwith `triggerRef`."},"690":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-34","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#single-selection","content":"A `MenuGroup` with `selectionMode=\"single\"` lets one item be selected at a time.\nDrive it with `selectedKeys` + `onSelectionChange` or seed it uncontrolled with\n`defaultSelectedKeys`. Keys correspond to each `MenuItem`'s `id`."},"691":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-35","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#sizes","content":"`size` controls item density. Shown here as two standalone menus so both\nsizes are visible at once; in practice you set `size` on the `Menu` inside a\n`MenuTrigger`."},"692":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-36","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#submenu","content":"Nested menus via `SubmenuTrigger`."},"693":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-37","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#accessibility","content":"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"},"694":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-38","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#accessibility","content":"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"},"695":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-39","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#accessibility","content":"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"},"696":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-40","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#accessibility","content":"**Type to select**: jump to a matching item (string labels are used as `textValue`)"},"697":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-41","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#accessibility","content":"Multi-select items use RAC's `menuitemcheckbox` role; the checkbox indicator is\ndecorative (`aria-hidden`) and the item owns interaction"},"698":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-42","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"Give each selectable `MenuItem` a stable `id`, and provide the `Menu` an\n`aria-label` when there is no visible label."},"699":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-43","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"Use a leading `icon` for recognition, not as the only label - keep a text label."},"700":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-44","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"Reserve checkbox groups for multi-select; use plain groups for one-shot actions."},"701":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-45","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"A `Menu` is a collection: it only renders `MenuItem`, `MenuGroup`,\n`MenuSeparator`, and `SubmenuTrigger`. For rich content (a `Calendar`, a form),\nclose the menu from `onAction` and open a separate `Popover` anchored with\n`triggerRef` instead of putting it in a submenu."},"702":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"page","content":"MetricsLockup","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup"},"703":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-0","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","content":"The MetricsLockup component displays a single metric with an optional title, info tooltip, trend indicator, and description."},"704":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-1","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#installation","content":"Installation"},"705":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-2","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#examples","content":"Examples"},"706":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-3","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#default","content":"Default"},"707":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-4","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#with-trend","content":"With Trend"},"708":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-5","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#compact","content":"Compact"},"709":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-6","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"710":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-7","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#keyboard","content":"Keyboard"},"711":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-8","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#aria","content":"ARIA"},"712":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-9","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"713":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-10","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#props","content":"Props"},"714":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-11","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","content":"MetricsLockup displays a metric value prominently, with an optional title and tooltip for context, an optional trend icon to show direction of change, and a description label below the value."},"715":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-12","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#default","content":"A metric with a title, info tooltip, value, and description."},"716":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-13","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#with-trend","content":"Use the `trend` prop to show a directional icon next to the description. Accepts `'positive'`, `'negative'`, or `'neutral'`."},"717":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-14","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#compact","content":"Use the `compact` prop to render the metric value and description inline rather than stacked."},"718":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-15","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#keyboard","content":"Key"},"719":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-16","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#keyboard","content":"Description"},"720":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-17","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#keyboard","content":"Tab"},"721":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-18","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#keyboard","content":"Moves focus to the info trigger button and shows the tooltip"},"722":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-19","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#keyboard","content":"Escape"},"723":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-20","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#keyboard","content":"Closes the tooltip"},"724":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-21","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#aria","content":"The info trigger button uses `aria-label=\"More information\"` to describe its purpose."},"725":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-22","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#aria","content":"The tooltip uses `role=\"tooltip\"` and is associated with the info trigger via `aria-describedby`."},"726":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-23","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#aria","content":"The info trigger has a minimum touch target of 44×44px, achieved via a CSS pseudo-element, to meet WCAG 2.5.5."},"727":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-24","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#best-practices","content":"Keep tooltip content concise and informative."},"728":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-25","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#best-practices","content":"The `data` prop accepts strings or numbers — format currency and percentages before passing them in."},"729":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-26","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#best-practices","content":"`titleInfo` requires `title` to be set — the info icon is contextually tied to the title label. If `title` is absent, `titleInfo` has no effect."},"730":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-27","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#best-practices","content":"`trend` is intended to accompany `description` to provide temporal context (e.g. \"↑ +3% vs. last month\"). A trend icon alone, with no description, leaves the direction unanchored (\"up since *when*?\"). If `description` is not provided, `trend` has no effect."},"731":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"page","content":"NumberField","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field"},"732":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-0","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field","content":"NumberField is a numeric input with optional label, description, error message, min/max/step, and increment/decrement stepper buttons. Use it in forms for quantities, amounts, or percentages."},"733":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-1","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#installation","content":"Installation"},"734":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-2","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#examples","content":"Examples"},"735":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-3","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#default","content":"Default"},"736":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-4","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#number-field-controlled","content":"Number Field Controlled"},"737":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-5","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#number-field-invalid","content":"Number Field Invalid"},"738":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-6","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#number-field-disabled","content":"Number Field Disabled"},"739":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-7","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#number-field-hide-stepper","content":"Number Field Hide Stepper"},"740":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-8","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#number-field-value-scale","content":"Number Field Value Scale"},"741":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-9","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#format-options-numbering-system","content":"Format options (numbering system)"},"742":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-10","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#number-field-sizes","content":"Number Field Sizes"},"743":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-11","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"744":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-12","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#keyboard","content":"Keyboard"},"745":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-13","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#aria-and-labeling","content":"ARIA and labeling"},"746":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-14","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#best-practices","content":"Best practices"},"747":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-15","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#props","content":"Props"},"748":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-16","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#default","content":"Minimal usage with label, placeholder, and min/max."},"749":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-17","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#number-field-controlled","content":"Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state."},"750":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-18","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#number-field-invalid","content":"Use `isInvalid` with `errorMessage` for validation feedback."},"751":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-19","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#number-field-disabled","content":"Use `isDisabled` to prevent input."},"752":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-20","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#number-field-hide-stepper","content":"Use `hideStepper` to show only the input without +/- buttons."},"753":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-21","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#number-field-value-scale","content":"Use `minValue`, `maxValue`, and `step` to set the allowed values. Steps are calculated from the minimum value."},"754":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-22","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#format-options-numbering-system","content":"By default, NumberField displays the value using the numbering system for the user's locale. Use the `formatOptions` prop to override the numbering system by setting the Unicode numbering system locale extension."},"755":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-23","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#number-field-sizes","content":"Compare the supported `md` and `sm` visual sizes."},"756":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-24","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#keyboard","content":"When focus is in the input (and the field is not read-only), keyboard behavior follows common spinbutton-style conventions:"},"757":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-25","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#keyboard","content":"**Arrow Up** / **Arrow Down** (or **Up** / **Down**): increase or decrease by `step`"},"758":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-26","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#keyboard","content":"**Page Up** / **Page Down**: larger increase or decrease when supported"},"759":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-27","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#keyboard","content":"**Home** / **End**: jump to `minValue` or `maxValue` when those props are set"},"760":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-28","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#keyboard","content":"Stepper buttons are real buttons and follow standard button keyboard activation. Use &#x2A;*`incrementAriaLabel`*&#x2A; and &#x2A;*`decrementAriaLabel`** when the default labels are not enough in your locale or UI."},"761":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-29","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#aria-and-labeling","content":"The input is associated with the visible label and optional description and error content for assistive technologies."},"762":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-30","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#aria-and-labeling","content":"Invalid and required states are exposed to assistive technologies when you use `isInvalid`, `errorMessage`, and `isRequired`."},"763":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-31","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#aria-and-labeling","content":"Set &#x2A;*`isWheelDisabled`** if the value should not change when the user scrolls with a pointer wheel while the field is focused."},"764":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-32","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#best-practices","content":"Pair &#x2A;*`isInvalid`*&#x2A; with &#x2A;*`errorMessage`** so users get both visual and programmatic feedback."},"765":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-33","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#best-practices","content":"Remember valid steps start from &#x2A;*`minValue`**."},"766":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-34","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#best-practices","content":"Use &#x2A;*`isDisabled`*&#x2A; when the value cannot be changed; use &#x2A;*`isReadOnly`** when the value should be visible but not editable. Do not use them interchangeably."},"767":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-35","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#best-practices","content":"For currency or units, ensure &#x2A;*`formatOptions`** (and locale) match what users are allowed to type."},"768":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-36","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#props","content":"The `NumberField` component accepts the following props:"},"769":{"id":"/docs/components/modal","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","type":"page","content":"Modal","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/modal"},"770":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-0","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal","content":"The Modal component presents a dialog window over the page that focuses the user's attention on a single task or piece of information."},"771":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-1","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/modal#installation","content":"Installation"},"772":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-2","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/modal#examples","content":"Examples"},"773":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-3","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/modal#default","content":"Default"},"774":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-4","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/modal#controlled","content":"Controlled"},"775":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-5","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/c