d regions. Children use the `gridArea` prop for placement."],[852,"Use `Button` when you need a standard button control with button-specific sizing, layout, and visual variants."],[787,"Use `centered` to center the title and description, and `actionProps` to control the alignment and direction of the action buttons."],[382,"Use `children` as a render function to show different content based on the current zone state - here, swapping the default label for \"Drop to replace\" when a file is already selected and a new drag is active. The same `onDrop` handler services both the drag path and the `FileTrigger` click path, so either gesture replaces the selection."],[50,"Use `critical` only when the user truly cannot continue without resolving the issue. Overusing it reduces its impact."],[819,"Use `defaultActiveIndex` to set the starting page in uncontrolled mode."],[1050,"Use `description` for persistent guidance and `isRequired` when a value is required."],[1235,"Use `design=\"inline\"` to embed a tag within a sentence. The background and border are removed so the tag blends into the text flow."],[1049,"Use `formatOptions` for currency, percentages, measurements, and other locale-sensitive units so values display and announce their meaning."],[1503,"Use `formatValue` when the raw numbers in the tooltip should read like money, counts with separators, or whatever your product expects. The percentage of the total still formats on its own; your function only shapes the value column."],[752,"Use `hideStepper` to show only the input without +/- buttons."],[158,"Use `isDateUnavailable` for scattered disabled days; use `minValue` / `maxValue` for contiguous bounds."],[751,"Use `isDisabled` to prevent input."],[1291,"Use `isDisabled` to prevent input."],[1131,"Use `isDisabled` to prevent interaction."],[1026,"Use `isDisabled` when the value is visible but unavailable for interaction."],[1051,"Use `isDisabled` when the value should remain visible but unavailable for interaction.