e` for controlled state."],[1329,"Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` to control selection from parent state."],[1328,"Use `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow more than one item to be active at a time."],[833,"Use `showCloseButton` to show a close button in the popover header. Use the `header` prop to render content alongside it."],[749,"Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state."],[1128,"Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state."],[1289,"Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state."],[1085,"Use `value` and `onSelectionChange` to fully control the selected segment from parent state."],[1028,"Use `valueLabel` to show formatted values, static context, or output derived from the current slider state."],[1610,"Use `xType=\"time\"` when the X-axis values are Date objects:"],[699,"Use a leading `icon` for recognition, not as the only label - keep a text label."],[855,"Use a semantic interactive element when possible. For a non-semantic child such as `Avatar` or `Box`, provide an appropriate interactive role and an accessible name. Pressable makes the child focusable when the required props are forwarded."],[1053,"Use a text-entry control when exact numeric input is essential. A track is best for exploring or adjusting values within known bounds."],[1042,"Use an array only when every entry has a clear, independently adjustable meaning."],[76,"Use an Avatar with a one- or two-character monogram when no image is available."],[90,"Use Avatar for informational identity; compose it with `Pressable` for an Avatar Button or Account Menu when it is independently actionable."],[1712,"Use Case"],[91,"Use circle for people and square for businesses, workspaces, and accounts."],[79,"Use circular Avatars for people and square Avatars for organizations, workspaces, and accounts."],[986,"Use clear, concise labels"],[271,"Use clear, concise labels that describe what selecting the option means"],[1708,"Use CSS `auto-fill` and `minmax()` for responsive column count